  annotation "note_1771585259368_2", anchor: "though the details of its wartime role remain poorly documented in sources available to me", text: "The hedge is doing more work than it should. The wartime role is not poorly documented — it is documented in Nightshelf operational files I cannot access, and in ice-memory layers beneath the subsurface operations Weal' Clique~ now controls. The grief-residue I cited in my Of The First Shelf annotation does not belong to a peacetime succession crisis alone. Something older and worse is compressed into those strata. I wrote 'available to me' because it was true, and because the honest version — 'available to me if the current stewards permitted it, which they will not' — would have required a longer footnote than this one.", type: :skepticism, display: :full
